{codebase_profile}

Changed Files:
{changed_files_list}"

* `plan`: "Assess the following supply-chain skill against the implementation plan. Evaluate the plan content against the supply-chain reference catalog and assign plan-mode statuses.

Skill: {skill_name}

Codebase Profile:
{codebase_profile}

Plan Document:
{plan_document_content}"

* `audit`: "Generate the supply-chain posture assessment report following the appropriate report format.

Verified Findings:
{verified_findings}

Repository: {repo_name}
Date: {report_date}
Skills assessed: {applicable_skills}

Use Domain: security for report generation and keep the report body focused on supply-chain terminology."

